# Test of Sagittarius (Q224), its end: a level 39 Rogue at cond 13, wearing the Crescent Moon bow
# Gauen made and holding thirty Leto lizardman's blood, every script roll pinned to 1: a lizardman
# kill gives one more blood (thirty-one is no call of Kadesh); Kadesh slain with the bow in hand
# gives the talisman of Kadesh (cond 14); Hamil takes the blood, the bow and the talisman for the
# Mark of Sagittarius; then relog, and Bernard has nothing more. Expectations replay the reference
# trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q224_test_of_sagittarius_kadesh.golden
character Sagittarius 39
class 7
random always 1
quest Q224_TestOfSagittarius <state>=STARTED <cond>=13
